{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20798","headline":"走笔追王内丘 · 卢仝","name":"走笔追王内丘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自识夫子面，便获夫子心。\n夫子一啓颜，义重千黄金。\n平原孟尝骨已土，始有夫子堪知音。\n忽然夫子不语，带蓆帽，骑驴去。\n余对醁醽不能斟，君且来，余之瞻望心悠哉。\n零雨其蒙愁不散，闲花寂寂斑堦苔。\n不如对此景，含笑倾金罍。\n莫问四肢畅，暂取眉头开。\n弦琴待夫子，夫子来不来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}